      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "她很难过，我很想一直在她身边。",
      "traditional": "她很難過，我很想一直在她身邊。",
      "pinyin": "tā hěn nán guò wǒ hěn xiǎng yì zhí zài tā shēn biān",
      "english": "Today I saw Lili cry. Lili told me that she broke up with her boyfriend Little He!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "She was very sad, and I wanted to stay by her side."
    },
    {
